[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13926.389, "timestamp": "03:52:06", "text": "想說，呃，我覺得是時候停止拖延，直接上網站了。所以，我一直在瀏覽 Frame 網站，因為它有一個 AI 功能，所以我用 AI 功能製作了一個模板，然後我做了一些東西。用起來有點難，不過我覺得還好吧。我不知道。還"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13929.11, "timestamp": "03:52:09", "text": "不錯。最"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13931.389, "timestamp": "03:52:11", "text": "有挑戰性的是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13934.71, "timestamp": "03:52:14", "text": "呃，呃，我之前"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13937.349, "timestamp": "03:52:17", "text": "在我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13939.189, "timestamp": "03:52:19", "text": "Twitch 直播中談到的那件事，我當時真的花了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13941.15, "timestamp": "03:52:21", "text": "四五個"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13943.75, "timestamp": "03:52:23", "text": "直播時間在白板上畫圖，規劃我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13948.349, "timestamp": "03:52:28", "text": "整個網站的想法。  嗯，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13950.99, "timestamp": "03:52:30", "text": "我覺得，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13957.67, "timestamp": "03:52:37", "text": "呃，我覺得這會很痛苦，因為費用會很"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13960.389, "timestamp": "03:52:40", "text": "昂貴。嗯，但我會盡量把"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13962.469, "timestamp": "03:52:42", "text": "所有東西都放進去，而且"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13973.51, "timestamp": "03:52:53", "text": "我確實都放進去了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13975.79, "timestamp": "03:52:55", "text": "。所以不用擔心。  我會在Twitch上進行"}]